silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeSousTotalizingLegAboutVetRecord', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, JoC §6.18: Hom(VetRecord77, Mittens) contains the \"about\" arrow; sous reads this set without modifying it." .
